Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 01:15:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild the 11 verified fixes against f2d68a8

Path A: cassette owns domain truth (QualityResult; core delegates
scoring/diagnosis and wraps structural fields; IntentSignal carries
classification; _TIER_MAP translation; IVR baseline 0.6->0.7).
Ledger: manifest-based recovery with atomic writes, resume-on-restart,
verify that actually compares; Postgres JSONB double-decode removed.
RL: dead seed removed, learning test made deterministic.
Tests: contract test reads QualityResult; conftest fails return-False.

Suite: 79/79, stable across repeated runs.
